        {
          "id": 1758443398,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "Sorry for the small alignment issue. Not sure why I've missed it.\n\nWhy? Simple: If you're running WG on a small screen, a lot of space is taken up by the recent files list. This included a lot of empty space, which could be used to display the interface list.\nI rarely use the recent files option and if I do, it's only via the menu bar.",
